<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not fully established- USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not fully established- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested on a live basis, compared with Tuesday's close, USDA said. On a carcass basis, steers and heifers were not fully established, with a lower undertone noted. Steers:  Select and Choice 2-4 1200-1250 lbs few 103.00-104.00 Reported sales for Wednesday: 300  Week to Date: 23,500</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
